WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.952
MuSc is a training-free, prompt-free pipeline with
three pieces.

00:00:04.032 --> 00:00:07.983
First, local neighborhood aggregation at multiple degrees,

00:00:08.063 --> 00:00:12.015
representing each patch at several scales to
capture tiny and large defects.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:16.047
Second, mutual scoring, where every test image
scores every other.

00:00:16.127 --> 00:00:20.078
Third,

00:00:20.158 --> 00:00:24.110
re-scoring with a constrained image-level
neighborhood that cleans the final decision.
